{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 8,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then answered Bildad the Shuhite, and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How long wilt thou speak these things?\nAnd ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "how long",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall the words of thy mouth be ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a mighty wind?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Doth God pervert justice?\nOr doth the Almighty pervert righteousness?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thy children have sinned against him,\nAnd he hath delivered them into the hand of their transgression;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou wouldest seek diligently unto God,\nAnd make thy supplication to the Almighty;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou wert pure and upright:\nSurely now he would awake for thee,\nAnd make the habitation of thy righteousness prosperous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And though thy beginning was small,\nYet thy latter end would greatly increase.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For inquire, I pray thee, of the former age,\nAnd apply thyself to that which their fathers have searched out",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "(For we are but of yesterday, and know nothing,\nBecause our days upon earth are a shadow);",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shall not they teach thee, and tell thee,\nAnd utter words out of their heart?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Can the rush grow up without mire?\nCan the flag grow without water?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whilst it is yet in its greenness, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not cut down,\nIt withereth before any ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "other",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " herb.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So are the paths of all that forget God;\nAnd the hope of the godless man shall perish:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whose confidence shall break in sunder,\nAnd whose trust is a spider’s web.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He shall lean upon his house, but it shall not stand:\nHe shall hold fast thereby, but it shall not endure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He is green before the sun,\nAnd his shoots go forth over his garden.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His roots are wrapped about the ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "stone",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "-heap,\nHe beholdeth the place of stones.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If he be destroyed from his place,\nThen it shall deny him, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", I have not seen thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, this is the joy of his way;\nAnd out of the earth shall others spring.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God will not cast away a perfect man,\nNeither will he uphold the evil-doers.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He will yet fill thy mouth with laughter,\nAnd thy lips with shouting.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.8.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.8.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that hate thee shall be clothed with shame;\nAnd the tent of the wicked shall be no more.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
